        //Per-dome vertex colours: 92 sRGB RRGGBB values per dome, vertex order matching GEOMETRY, captured
        //from the built models before the sRGB->linear rewrite. Each dome uses only 9-11 distinct colours,
        //banded by latitude ring (six domes carry a few hand-painted ring exceptions below the horizon),
        //but the table stores the colour per vertex so the reproduction is exact rather than interpreted.
        //Alpha was 255 on every vertex of every dome (PremultiplyVertexColors was therefore a no-op).
